## Secrets and variables

Set as repository secrets and variables, once per environment with the prefix `UAT_` or `PROD_`, for example `UAT_ACR_SERVER` and `PROD_ACR_SERVER`. The table lists the name without the prefix. There are no GitHub Environments, so any workflow in the repo can read the prod values: protect `main` with required reviews and checks. `/gha:secrets` sets them.

